            "compression": 873,
            "text": "\n/* 手风琴样式 */\n#accordion001{ border:1px solid #e2e3e5;}\n\n  .l-panel-header{\n/*\tpadding:5px;\n\tline-height:15px;\n\tcolor:#15428b;\n\tfont-weight:bold;\n\tfont-size:12px;\n\tbackground:url('img/panel_title.png') repeat-x;\n\tposition:relative;\n\tborder:1px solid #99BBE8;*/\n}\n.l-accordion-header{\n\tborder-width:0 0 1px;\n}\n.l-accordion-header{\n\t/*background:#E0ECFF;\n\tborder-top-width:0;\n\tcursor:pointer;*/\n}\n\n\n.acco > a:hover,\n.acco > a:focus {\n  text-decoration: none;\n  background-color: #eee;\n}\n\n/*from  */\n.a-panel-group {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n.a-panel-group .panel {\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n.a-panel-group .panel + .panel {\n  margin-top: 5px;\n}\n.a-panel-group .panel-heading {\n  border-bottom: 0;\n}\n.a-panel-group .panel-heading + .panel-collapse > .panel-body,\n.a-panel-group .panel-heading + .panel-collapse > .list-group {\n  border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n.a-panel-group .panel-footer {\n  border-top: 0;\n}\n.a-panel-group .panel-footer + .panel-collapse .panel-body {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\n}\n.a-panel-default {\n  border-color: #ddd;\n}\n.a-panel-default > .panel-heading {\n  color: #333;\n  background-color: #f5f5f5;\n  border-color: #ddd;\n}\n.a-panel-default > .panel-heading + .panel-collapse > .panel-body {\n  border-top-color: #ddd;\n}\n.a-panel-default > .panel-heading .badge {\n  color: #f5f5f5;\n  background-color: #333;\n}\n.a-panel-default > .panel-footer + .panel-collapse > .panel-body {\n  border-bottom-color: #ddd;\n}\n\n"
