            "compression": -1,
            "text": "\n.wingsTabSelect_head_ul{float:left;width:100%;padding-top;5px;font-size:14px;}\n.wingsTabSelect_head_ul li{float:left;width:80px;margin-left:2.5px;margin-left:2.5px;height:30px;line-height:30px;\n\tborder-top:1px solid #dddddd;border-left:1px solid #dddddd;border-right:1px solid #dddddd;text-align:center;\n\tcursor:pointer;}\n.wingsTabSelect_head_body{float:left;width:100%;border-top:1px solid #dddddd;font-size:14px;}\n.wingsTabSelect_head_body li{float:left;width:80px;height:30px;line-height:30px;text-align:center;\n\tcursor:pointer;}\n\n.wingsTabSelect_head_ul li.action,.wingsTabSelect_head_ul li:hover{background-color:#D5EBFF;color:#fff;}\n\n.wingsTabSelect_head_body li.action,.wingsTabSelect_head_body li:hover{background-color:#D5EBFF;color:red;}\n\n\n\n\n\n"
