            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "compression": 851,
            "text": "\n\t.wingsSelect-table{\n\t\twidth:100%;\n\t}\n\t.wingsSelect-td1{\n\t\twidth:100%;\n\t}\n\t.wingsSelect_down_img{\n\t\twidth:17px; height:24px;\n\t\tbackground:url(\"image/trigger.gif\") left top no-repeat;display:block;\n\t}\n\t.wingsSelect-list{\n\t\tposition:absolute;\n\t\tz-index:100;\n\t\tbackground-color:white;\n\t\tbackground-attachment:scroll;\n\t\tBORDER-BOTTOM: #98c0f4 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-LEFT: #98c0f4 1px solid; \n\t\tWIDTH: 160px; \n\t\tZOOM: 1; \n\t\t/* DISPLAY: none; */ \n\t\tBACKGROUND: #ddecfe; OVERFLOW: hidden; \n\t\tBORDER-TOP: #98c0f4 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-RIGHT: #98c0f4 1px solid; \n\t\tLEFT: 30px;\n\t\tOVERFLOW-y: auto;\n\t}\n\t.wingsSelect-list-inner {\n\t    font-family:Microsoft Yahei;\n\t    font-size:14px;\n\t\tPOSITION: relative; ZOOM: 1; BACKGROUND: white; OVERFLOW: auto;\n\t}\n\t.wingsSelect-list .wingsSelect-selected {\n\t\tpadding:4px;\n\t\tpadding:4px;\n\t\tBACKGROUND-COLOR: #c3daf9; \n\t\tCURSOR: pointer; \n\t\t/* BORDER-BOTTOM: #369 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-LEFT: #369 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-TOP: #369 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-RIGHT: #369 1px solid; */\n\t}\n\t\n\t.wingsSelect-list .wingsSelect-selected-fix {\n\t\tpadding:4px;\n\t\tBACKGROUND-COLOR: #c3daf9; \n\t\tCURSOR: pointer; \n\t\t/* BORDER-BOTTOM: #369 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-LEFT: #369 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-TOP: #369 1px solid; \n\t\tBORDER-RIGHT: #369 1px solid; */\n\t}\n\t\n\t.wingsSelect-list-item{\n\t\tpadding: 4px;\n\t}\n\n\n\t.wingsSelect-list .wingsSelect-selected-none {\n\t\tDISPLAY: none\n\t}\n\t\n\t.wingsSelect-disable-class{\n\t\tcolor:#8e8f93;\n\t}\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t"
