            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "compression": 844,
            "text": "\n/* MENU */\n\n.nav_wings_menu {\n background: #fff;\n float: left;\n margin: 0;\n padding: 0;\n border: 1px solid #0098cb;\n border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li a, .nav_wings_menu li {\n \t/*float: left;*/\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li {\n list-style: none;\n position: relative;\n border-bottom: solid 1px #0098cb;\n width:120px;\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li a {\n text-decoration: none;\n color:  #555;\n background: #fafdff;\n height:28px;\n display:block;\n text-align: center;\n line-height: 28px;\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li a:hover {\n background: #0098cb;\n color: #fff;\n}\n\n\n/* Submenu */\n\n/*lei：所有子菜单隐藏*/\n.nav_wings_menu li ul {\n display: none;\n position: absolute;\n left: 0;\n top: 100%;\n padding: 0;\n margin: 0;\n border: 1px solid #0098cb;\n border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n/*lei：有子菜单的显示*/\n.nav_wings_menu li:hover > ul {\n left: 100%;\n top: -1px;\n display: block;\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li ul li, .nav_wings_menu li ul li a {\n float: none;\n width: 100px;\n background-color: #fff;\n font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li ul li {\n _display: inline; /* for IE6 */\n}\n\n.nav_wings_menu li ul li a {\n display: block;\n}\n\n/* SUBSUB Menu */\n\n.nav_wings_menu li ul li ul {\n display: none;\n}\n\n/*lei：设置子菜单右侧显示*/\n.nav_wings_menu li ul li:hover ul {\n /*left: 100%;\n top: 0; */\n}\n\n\n/*0802 new add ljw*/\n#zcd_begin input{\n background-color: #0098cb;\n outline: none;\n border: none;\n color: #fff;\n margin: 5px;\n padding: 3px 10px;\n}\n#zcd_begin input:hover{\n background-color: #0188b5;\n}\n\n.nav1-tabs>li>a, .nav1-tabs>li>a:focus{\n z-index: 0!important;\n}"
          },
