            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "compression": 1930,
            "text": "\n/* wingsToolbar */\n.wingsToolbar{ width:100%;height:40px;top:0px;background-color:#f7f7f7;}\n\n/* wingsTab */\n.one{background:#479fe6;}\n.nav-tabs > li > a{border-radius: 0 0 0 0;margin-right: 0; border: 0;}\n.one a{color:#fff; font-weight:bold;}\nli.active {background: #fff;}\n.nav-tabs > li.active > a, .nav-tabs > li.active > a:hover, .nav-tabs > li.active > a:focus {background-color: #fff; border:0;}\nnav2{\n  display: block;\n}\n.nav-tabs {border-bottom: 1px solid #c2d4e0;}\n\n.nav2:after {\n  clear: both;\n}\n.nav2:before,\n.nav2:after{\n  display: table;\n  content: \" \";\n}\n\n.nav2 {\n  padding-left: 0;\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n  \n}\n.one .nav2 > li>a {\n  position: relative;\n  display: block;\n  border-right:1px solid #58abeb;\n \n}\n.nav2 > li > a {\n  position: relative;\n  display: block;\n  padding: 10px 15px;\n}\n.nav2 > li > a:hover,\n.nav2 > li > a:focus {\n  text-decoration: none;\n  /*background-color: #eee;*/\n}\n.nav2 > li.disabled > a {\n  color: #777;\n}\n.nav2 > li.disabled > a:hover,\n.nav2 > li.disabled > a:focus {\n  /*color: #777;*/\n  text-decoration: none;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  background-color: transparent;\n}\n.nav2 .open > a,\n.nav2 .open > a:hover,\n.nav2 .open > a:focus {\n  background-color: #eee;\n  border-color: #337ab7;\n}\n.nav2 .nav2-divider {\n  height: 1px;\n  margin: 9px 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  /*background-color: #e5e5e5;*/\n}\n.nav2 > li > a > img {\n  max-width: none;\n}\n\n.two{background:#fff; border-bottom:2px solid #e7e5e2;font-family: \"微软雅黑\"; font-size:16px;}\n.two a{color:#333;}\n.two > li.active > a, .two > li.active > a:hover, .two > li.active > a:focus{color:#33cc99;border-bottom:2px solid #33cc99; }\n.two li{margin-left:5px;margin-right:5px;}\n#.line{border-right:1px solid #ccc;height:12px;margin-top: 15px;}\n\n\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav-tabs > li.active > a, .wings_tab_s0 .nav-tabs > li.active > a:hover,  .wings_tab_s0 .nav-tabs > li.active > a:focus {\n    background-color: #505872;\n    border: 0;\n    color: #fff;}\n.wings_tab_s0 li.active {\n    background: #fff;\n}\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav-tabs,.wings_tab_s0 .tab-content{display:inline-block;}\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav-tabs > li {\n    margin-bottom: -1px;\n}\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav2 {\n    padding-left: 0;\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    list-style: none;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 30px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav2 > li > a {\n    position: relative;\n    display: block;\n    padding: 10px 12px 10px 7px;\n    background: blanchedalmond;\n}\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav2 > li > a {\n    position: relative;\n    display: block;\n    padding: 10px 12px 10px 7px;\n    background: #fff;\n}\n.wings_tab_s0 .tab-content{    position: fixed;overflow:scroll;width:99%; }\n.wings_tab_s0 .nav-tabs,.wings_tab_s0 .tab-content{display:inline-block;}\n\n.nav-tabs.three, .tab-content {\n\n}\n\n .tab-content {width:100%;}\n.wingsTab_main_class ul.nav2.nav-tabs >li.tab_unused a{background-color:#eee;color:#b0b0b0;border:0px}\n\n\n\n"
          },
